notes.1-424:
for (int r = 0; r < n; r++) {
            freq[s[r] - 'A']++;

            maxFreq = max(maxFreq, freq[s[r] - 'A']);

            while ((r - l + 1) - maxFreq > k) {
                freq[s[l] - 'A']--;
                l++;
            }

            maxLen = max(maxLen, r - l + 1);
        }

Very Important loop on how we access and store the maxFrequencies of a character and shrink the window.

The main idea is sliding window with a while check of window size-maxFreq>k
